      "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
      "body": "Hi @nathon-lee,\r\nThank you for reporting! \r\n\r\nI found that we already have a [fallback](https://github.com/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/blob/6c59d5446afd8900218121ecfd00003a6cde2b9e/deepspeed/runtime/sequence_parallel/parallel_state_sp.py#L95) from `get_model_parallel_world_size` to `get_sequence_parallel_world_size`.\r\nThis was introduced in #7649. Can you make sure that the latest version still raises the error?",
